essa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A randomized pilot trial comparing methylprednisolone plus a cytotoxic agent versus synthetic adrenocorticotropic hormone in idiopathic membranous nephropathy</article-title><source>Am J Kidney Dis</source><year>2006</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>233</fpage><lpage>240</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16431252</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1053/j.ajkd.2005.10.016</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>